      "created_at": "2018-12-26T17:23:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You do exactly what the card says, and no more - flip it (except for one card that says to move it to your hand, so you do that).&nbsp;If you were to move it somewhere else, it would say so. The rulebook says to do what cards say to do, so I think that covers this =)</p>",
